  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>T he lands of Lyonesse have shaped unique traditions and forms of power. From Grimfolk raiders and spellbinders to saintly champions and selkie wardens, these subclasses reflect the legends of the setting, allowing characters to become part of Lyonesse’s mythology. Barbarian Path of the Provoked Among the Grimfolk of Lyonesse, strength is not measured by calm, but by how fiercely one answers insult and injury. The Path of the Provoked is born from warriors who believe that wrath is a weapon to be sharpened, not restrained. These Barbarians do not seek battle, but once tested, they answer with overwhelming force. Each blow against them fuels their fury, each enemy a spark to the fire. Along the coasts where longships gather, their sagas are spoken with wary respect, for the Provoked do not forget, and they do not forgive.</p>"
    },
